- Loops: the outputs are whole loops, so state is per instance. Inputs don't loop: a looped input uses its first item and warns once per restart.
- Disabled: empty loops, false, and 0; the in-flight pass is dropped and no passes run.
- Muted: the same idle values as Disabled, with Available false.
